[E-TYPE-MISMATCH] Error: type mismatch
    ╭─[ reject/partial-sort-by.sw:14:77 ]
    │
 14 │ def sorted (numbers: List Nat): {Partial} (List Nat) := List.sortBy numbers bySteps
    │                                                                             ───┬───  
    │                                                                                ╰───── expected `Nat → Nat → Ordering`, but this has type `Nat → Nat → {Partial} Ordering`
    │ 
    │ Note: `List.sortBy` doesn't take partial callbacks: its callback has the type `Nat → Nat → Ordering`, which has no `{e}`, so it must finish, and `bySteps` is partial
────╯
